# roundon.part -- A round that takes all of the face its edge ends on
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A box with a sharp edge from 0 to 10, and behind it a box whose
# corner there is round in its outline and leans in.  The round of the
# sharp edge ends on the face between the two, takes all of it, and
# goes on into the cone.

profile p along y 0 0 0 side s0 30 0 0 30 20 0 0 20 0 side s3
profile q along y 0 0 1 30 0 0 30 20 0 0 20 0
extrude a from 0 to 10 p
extrude b from 10 to 30 q draft 1
union s a b
round 1 a.s3 a.s0
